              "content": "You extract structured data from CVs. Respond with valid JSON only, no extra text."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Extract structured information from this CV text. Be thorough and accurate. Use null for anything not found.\n\nCV TEXT: {{ $('Not empty text').item.json.text }}\n\nRespond in this exact JSON format:\n{\n  \"name\": \"<full name>\",\n  \"email\": \"<email or null>\",\n  \"phone\": \"<phone or null>\",\n  \"summary\": \"<brief professional summary>\",\n  \"education\": [\n    { \"institution\": \"<name>\", \"degree\": \"<degree title>\", \"field\": \"<field or null>\", \"year\": \"<graduation year or null>\" }\n  ],\n  \"experience\": [\n    { \"company\": \"<company>\", \"role\": \"<job title>\", \"duration\": \"<e.g. '2 years' or 'Jan 2020 - Dec 2022'>\", \"description\": \"<brief description>\" }\n  ],\n  \"skills\": [\"<skill1>\", \"<skill2>\"],\n  \"certifications\": [\"<cert1>\", \"<cert2>\"]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
