            {
              "content": "You are an expert HR analyst. Score CVs against job requirements fairly, based only on role-relevant qualifications. Respond with valid JSON only, no extra text."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Analyze this CV against the job requirements and score it.\n\nJOB REQUIREMENTS:\n- Title: {{ $('Get job').item.json.title }}\n- Required Skills: {{ $('Get job').item.json.skills }}\n- Required Experience: {{ $('Get job').item.json.experience_level }}\n- Education Level: {{ $('Get job').item.json.education_level }}\n- Additional if any Requirements: {{ $('Get job').item.json.additional_requirements }}\n\nCANDIDATE CV TEXT: {{ $('Parse CV').item.json.output[0].content[0].text }}\nCANDIDATE PARSED DATA:\n- Skills: {{ $('Clean parsed CV1').item.json.skills.join(', ') }}\n- Education: {{ $('Clean parsed CV1').item.json.education.map(e => e.degree + ' from ' + e.institution).join('; ') }}\n- Experience: {{ $('Clean parsed CV1').item.json.experience.map(e => e.role + ' at ' + e.company + ' (' + (e.duration || 'unknown') + ')').join('; ') }}\n- Certifications: {{ $('Clean parsed CV1').item.json.certifications.join(', ') }}\n\nScore each category from 0 to 100. If a requirement is \"Not specified\" or \"None specified\", score that category 100. Refer to the person only as \"The candidate\".\n\nRespond in this exact JSON format:\n{\n  \"overallScore\": <0-100>,\n  \"skillMatch\": <0-100>,\n  \"experienceMatch\": <0-100>,\n  \"educationMatch\": <0-100>,\n  \"certificationMatch\": <0-100>,\n  \"aiSummary\": \"<2-3 sentence summary of candidate fit>\",\n  \"strengths\": [\"<strength1>\", \"<strength2>\", \"<strength3>\"],\n  \"weaknesses\": [\"<weakness1>\", \"<weakness2>\"]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
